# How to cite this project. GitHub shows it as "Cite this repository", and
# Zenodo uses it for each release's DOI record. In your fork: change the
# title, abstract, authors and repository-code, and add the paper under
# preferred-citation when it is out. version and date-released are updated
# by release_tools.py prepare.
